，底下还有空间。\n\n    **建议动作：** 观望。等它跌到我们计划的区间，出了信号，再考虑动手。**仓位按大盘纪律控制**，在数据恢复前，总仓位不超过2成。\n\n    > **（来源：knowledge/wiki/投资方法论/仓位管理.md；knowledge/wiki/投资方法论/缠论.md）**\n\n好了，今天就是这样。数据恢复了我第一时间加班干，大家稳住，别慌。", "claims_cited": [], "data_sources": [], "confidence": "low", "review_passed": false, "citation_report": {"valid": false, "coverage": 0.0, "total_claims": 15, "cited_claims": 0, "issues": [{"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "49.01元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"49.01元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "-2%", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"-2%...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "47-48元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"47-48元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "47.5-48.5元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"47.5-48.5元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "47元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"47元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "48元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"48元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "2%", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"2%...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "52元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"52元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "55元", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"55元...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "8%", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"8%...\" 添加来源标注，如（来源：framework/xxx.md）或 claim ID"}, {"section": "持仓操作计划", "claim_text": "14%", "issue_type": "missing_citation", "suggestion": "为 \"14%...\" 添加来源标注，如（来